    {
      "key": "tb1ac8fe6af9298bc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A micro lot size is therefore 0.01 lot, or 1,000 units in a forex currency pair.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，微型手数为 0.01 手，即外汇货币对中的 1,000 个单位。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td9e83a3acae369ce",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A forex lot does not have one fixed dollar value. The question can refer either to the </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">pip value</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> of the position or to its approximate </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">notional market value</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">一手外汇没有固定的美元价值。该问题可以涉及头寸的</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">点值</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">或其近似</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">名义市场价值</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">。</span>"
    },
