    {
      "key": "t6c6e4fcbd3c74e67",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The notional-value figures simply illustrate currency units multiplied by an example EUR/USD rate somewhere around 1.00–1.10. They are not live prices, margin requirements, account deposits or the cash amount needed to open the trade.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">名义价值数据只是用货币单位数量乘以约1.00–1.10的示例EUR/USD汇率。它们并非实时报价、保证金要求、账户存款额，也不是开仓所需的现金金额。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf784c991a8334453",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Does Position Sizing Work Beyond Forex Pairs?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">除了外汇货币对之外，头寸调整如何发挥作用？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdd26dc8331e88ac5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This distinction matters when using searches such as XAUUSD lot size calculator, NAS100 lot size calculator or BTCUSD lot size calculator. A forex calculation should not simply be copied onto another CFD without checking its specification.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在使用 XAUUSD 手数计算器、NAS100 手数计算器或 BTCUSD 手数计算器等搜索时，这种区别很重要。不应在不检查其规格的情况下将外汇计算简单地复制到另一个差价合约上。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t44f7d4c292161048",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1.00 lot = 100 troy ounces</span>",
