      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1.00 手 = 100 金衡盎司</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7bb5ad76f22d0f6c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For a 1.00-lot position, a $10 price move would represent:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于 1.00 手头寸，价格变动 10 美元代表：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3b8c129fbcff2383",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">$100 ÷ $1,000 = 0.10 lot</span>",
